You should definite following function :

F(x) = x*log(x) when x > 0, and F(x) = 0 when x = 
0.

 

x*log(x) goes to 0 in limit (when x goes to 0), but it is 
not definite in point 0, and it's the reason S+ returns NA.

Good Luck

