I don't think you can use the MARGIN argument directly to do what you want.
I would approach the problem by creating a new data frame that 'stacks' the
data from adjacent columns into a single column, and then calling apply:

        dat <- data.frame( x1=rnorm(1000), x2=rnorm(1000), x3=rnorm(1000,2),
x4=rnorm(1000,2) )

        stacked <- rbind( as.matrix(dat[,c(1,3)]), as.matrix(dat[,c(2,4)]) )

        apply(stacked, 2, sum)

-Greg

