Try sapply.  In this case you want to send it the indices of the columns of
interest.  In your case, you want to iterate through 1/2 of the columns.
The following will take the difference of two adjoining columns:

x.1 <- matrix(runif(100), ncol=10)
x.2 <- sapply(1:(ncol(x.1)/2), function(x)
    {
        x.1[,x*2-1] - x.1[,x*2]
    })

