On Thu, 7 Feb 2002, Bob Porter wrote:

> Mark ROTE: Actually, I believe that you will find that the log
> function goes to negative infinity as x approaches 0.

> IRITE: Hmm.  I have approached zero in log functions before and have
> never gotten to negative infinity.  If you have gotten there, tell us
