You can use is.element. Here's a scaled-down example, selecting rows that 
have an even number in the first column:

> mat <- matrix(sample(1:10, 30,replace=T), 10, 3)
> mat
      [,1] [,2] [,3]
 [1,]    6    4    3
 [2,]    5    1    2
 [3,]    7    7    8
 [4,]    7    1   10
 [5,]    2    8    5
 [6,]    4    4    5
 [7,]    6    5    2
 [8,]    9    5    1
 [9,]    3    8    2
[10,]    7    3    4
> mat[is.element(mat[,1], 2*1:5),]
     [,1] [,2] [,3]
[1,]    6    4    3
[2,]    2    8    5
[3,]    4    4    5
[4,]    6    5    2
>

I hope that this helps,
 John

