> attributes(b)
>
> temp6 <- lm( y ~ -1 + a + b:x, x=T)
> temp6$x
>
> then there is no evidence that the contrasts were ever used, I expected
> the same x-matrix as temp3$x above.  Why are the contrasts not used in
